0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Every practitioner starts from the same sorting question: is the activity offering, selling, or advising? Six Minutes maps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (that split to three statutes, issuers under the 1933 Act, broker-dealers under the 1934 Act, advisers under the 1940 Act,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (and stresses that the SEC checks disclosure, not investment quality [eb9QUJSQh9o @ 00:00:22]. Business with Mr. G) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (draws the line inside the broker-dealer itself: a broker is an agent earning commission, a dealer is a principal earning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (the spread, and both sit under dual oversight from the SEC and FINRA as the SRO [s3gi1d4BLP0 @ 00:03:16]. Series) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (7 Whisperer pushes the same taxonomy from the street side, calling the broker-dealer the overarching firm that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (executes transactions and flagging that commissions can only be paid to broker-dealers [Nkm4yUiFRmc @ 00:01:57].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (CertFuel adds the one-capacity-per-trade rule, so a firm picks agent or principal on each ticket, never both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm ([ekpLm58t3ok @ 00:01:45]. The people inside the firm are locked in too: reps must be associated with a broker-dealer,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (the SIE needs no sponsor but is only a prerequisite, and a Series 7 needs sponsorship. Selling away from that structure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (can end in fines, suspension, or a permanent bar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (The exclusion drill is equally settled. Basic Wisdom's Brandon puts the motive bluntly: registration means forms, fees,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (lawyers, and accountants, so if there is an opportunity to avoid it, financial professionals will take it, and the baseline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (exclusions are agents, issuers, and banks [WN_8pEobWVw @ 00:01:05]. CertFuel lists the same three plus certain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (firms with no in-state office, and both trainers carve out the same trap: a bank holding company with brokerage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (operations, the Bank of America and Merrill Lynch pattern, is not excluded [ekpLm58t3ok @ 00:03:04]. The office test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (is where registration bites hardest. Brandon says that if a broker-dealer has a physical location customers can go to,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ('you better believe they're going to be subject to registration in that state.' CertFuel then strips away the cushion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (advisers enjoy: anti-fraud rules apply to everyone, broker-dealers get zero de minimis clients while advisers get five,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm ('burn this zero into your brain right now,' and SEC registration does not replace state registration, even though federal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (law caps state demands on capital, custody, margin, records, bonding, and reporting [3z_ALLqRZ2E @ 00:05:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (CertFuel's federal-side drill adds that banks get only activity-specific exceptions rather than the clean state-law) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (exclusion [deQ3XNDiApo @ 00:02:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (On M&A deals the consensus is that the relief is real but narrow. ALC Lawcast's Laura Anthony traces the federal path) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (to the SEC no-action letter of January 31, 2014, which said the SEC 'would not require broker-dealer registration for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (M&A brokers arranging for the sale of privately held businesses,' while excluding Exchange Act reporting companies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm ([o-XOblDUBuI @ 00:00:34]. In a companion episode Anthony narrows the target further, excluding public or shell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (companies and defining a private company by reference to Sections 12 and 15\(d\) [R0kgCi34_1s @ 00:01:37]. IBBA's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (panel confirms the Exchange Act was amended but stresses that federal law does not preempt the states, which can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (adopt the exemption by rule, order, or law; 23 states carry M&A-specific exemptions, Washington adds a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (private-placement route for 24, and 26 states plus DC remain [7mV4t9a4PvE @ 00:06:51]. The panel is equally blunt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (about the cost of ignoring the gap. Fees, including recouped expenses, become uncollectible, enforcement usually starts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (with a disgruntled client, competitor, or ex-employee, a Nevada broker case ran about $500K in legal fees, and) Tj ET
