q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 680.35 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 684.35 Tm (Brokerage owners agree that the agent makes the company. They recruit experienced producers, sell value instead) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 665.12 504.00 15.22 re S Q
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 669.12 Tm (of the cheapest split, and scale slowly, because brokerages fail from carrying too many costs too soon. Garth Ward) Tj ET
q 0 0 0 RG 54.00 649.90 504.00 15.22 re S Q
