BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (license. Requirements vary by state and cover education classes, industry experience and an exam, and without the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (license nobody carries agents under them [QqzqH1glUuA @ 00:04:17]. Ben Eger spells out what that license puts on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (the owner's desk. The supervising broker oversees licensed work, records, advertising and entrusted funds, and no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (office policy erases that responsibility. Earnest money sits in trust with an accurate ledger, separate from operating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (revenue. Paying office expenses out of a buyer's deposit is conversion, not merely commingling [DPj-ieo_sSM @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (00:01:40]. Dee Kumar adds the remaining baseline. Escrow funds are never commingled or converted, and every ad) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (carries the broker ID and license number, with no blind ads. There is also a hard antitrust line against colluding, fixing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (prices, allocating markets or forcing tie-in agreements [V5gUCAcegsY @ 00:04:15]. Both instructors stress that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (commissions are negotiable and not fixed by law, so every split and fee is open to design [V5gUCAcegsY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (00:02:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (The second point of agreement is that agents are the brokerage's real customers, and experienced producers are the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (inventory worth chasing. Bob Knakal opens the commercial panel with a line the other founders echo: the agent makes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (the company [0u9CyKG6vj4 @ 00:00:00]. Jim Remley learned this the expensive way. The early model of monthly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (two-hour seminars for new licensees produced an 87% attrition rate and kept roughly 1 in 10 recruits [YKfvldXPHWw) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (@ 00:08:38]. Remley then pivoted to agents with more than two years in the business and $2 to $10 million in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (production. That shift carried the firm to 17 offices [YKfvldXPHWw @ 00:10:00]. Garth Ward narrows the target) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (further to the on-the-bubble agent: $1.5 to $3.5 million in volume and $50K to $120K GCI, poached from smaller) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (independent brokerages [OFzI2gK-nps @ 00:17:01]. Ward also notes where most shops stall. Most brokerages sit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (around 4 agents, few reach 10, and most plateau near 30 agents per office [OFzI2gK-nps @ 00:03:41]. Tim Garrity's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (first roughly 10 agents came through relationships. After that, better splits, a cap system and a handbook co-written) Tj ET
