BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (and then keep them close.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (The third consensus is that owners win on value delivered, not on the cheapest split. Remley is blunt: top agents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (generally don't work for the lowest-cost office, and competing on lowest cost is a fallacy. That is why the model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (charges a $50 to $75 monthly tech-stack fee instead of racing to zero [YKfvldXPHWw @ 00:34:16]. Brandon) Tj ET
