BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 605.77 Tm (The first economics check is that owning the brokerage may pay less than selling. Kyle Handy tells new brokers to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 590.55 Tm (expect negative cash flow 'for at least a few years.' He states flatly that brokerages fail because they scale too quickly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 575.32 Tm (and carry too many costs [QqzqH1glUuA @ 00:03:40]. Jim Remley plans for two years of reduced personal production) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 560.10 Tm (when opening an office, because the owner's own deals carry the build [YKfvldXPHWw @ 00:08:08]. Garth Ward) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.87 Tm (lived the numbers at scale. At about 80 agents he hired managers, a CEO and a front desk, the raised fees barely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 529.65 Tm (covered staff, and margins ran around 10% [OFzI2gK-nps @ 00:33:14]. By his math the model only works near 1,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 514.42 Tm (agents, roughly 20 locations of 50 agents each. Multi-state licensing would have taken about 16 years to reach 15) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 499.20 Tm (states. Legal exposure compounds it: two lawsuits in four years cost just under $200K combined because an entity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.97 Tm (cannot represent itself [OFzI2gK-nps @ 00:38:15]. Ward also warns that Zillow leads worked at 50/50 are team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 468.75 Tm (income, not brokerage profit. Buyout offers that once came in at 3x net on a three-year earnout now look closer to 2x.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 453.52 Tm (His conclusion is blunt: a high-producing agent will make more money than a brokerage owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 438.30 Tm (Undercharging is the most repeated pricing mistake. Joe Mendoza served as state broker for a flat-fee firm charging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.07 Tm (about $500 per transaction. He calls it a model for going broke unless title, lending and insurance revenue fill the gap;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.85 Tm (he was micromanaged there and resigned [VcNeWYSFiDE @ 00:09:32]. At Keller Williams he recruited agents and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 392.62 Tm (still earned 'zero' because profit share depends on the office being profitable. Garth Ward admits Park Place) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.40 Tm (undercharged early and ran an undialed brand that forced a full niche rebrand. He also found that building proprietary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.17 Tm (tech cost more than the fees it replaced [OFzI2gK-nps @ 00:11:48]. Jim Remley rejects the race to the bottom entirely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.95 Tm (Parity items like a mobile site, company email, CRM and CMA/AVM sit behind a $50 to $75 monthly tech fee, and top) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 331.72 Tm (agents generally do not work for the lowest-cost office [YKfvldXPHWw @ 00:34:16]. From the other side of the desk,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 316.50 Tm (Brandon Mulrenin warns agents that broker-centric firms bury costs in printing, color printing, technology, broker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.27 Tm (review, E&O, office and desk fees. Then they hit agents with surprise month-end bills [R_uWZH6c9lI @ 00:07:18].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.05 Tm (Mulrenin also calls payouts that take weeks unacceptable; 24 to 48 hours by direct deposit is the standard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.82 Tm (Deal-side failures cluster around time, ego and bad numbers. Christine McDannell says the hard part is holding the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.60 Tm (whole deal together. McDannell watched a COVID lockdown kill a multi-million-dollar sale the day before closing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.37 Tm (which is the origin of the rule that time kills deals [7jkOz9WXEh8 @ 00:12:10]. McDannell also fields sellers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.15 Tm (anchored on AI valuations. One claimed $5M on $150K net after a Claude run, a business McDannell put at about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.92 Tm ($900K max. Another seller invented $6M on roughly $50K to $120K net [7jkOz9WXEh8 @ 00:33:07]. A Bay Area) Tj ET
