BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 510.55 Tm (figures carry an asterisk: revenue and profit are annualized off the last three months, meaning those months multiplied) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.32 Tm (by four, and Matcha calls three months really short when six is the usual floor [r4fmjknWB7o @ 00:06:30]. On Quiet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.10 Tm (Light, the stale-data problem shows up differently: listings that sit longer than a month can carry a prospectus still) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.87 Tm (showing August numbers in October, even though September is fully closed [l-9E6P1CSEc @ 00:10:33]. The second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 449.65 Tm (trap is forgetting who the broker works for. Matcha is blunt that brokers represent the seller and earn a cut of the sale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.42 Tm (price, 15% at FEI, so they are incentivized to sell for as much as possible and are not really on your side when you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.20 Tm (negotiate [r4fmjknWB7o @ 00:14:20]. Then the fees leak at closing. FEI is the only brokerage Matcha knows that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.97 Tm (charges buyers a fee, capped at $1,000, and escrow.com adds a $75 domain holding fee plus a percentage fee by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 388.75 Tm (transaction size, with the smallest fees near 0.89 on a wire transfer; Matcha warns that credit card points will not make) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 373.52 Tm (up the difference [r4fmjknWB7o @ 00:14:57].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.30 Tm (Infrastructure buyers get burned by power promises. Data Center Build Academy opens with the nightmare: a company) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.07 Tm (buys two hundred acres of flat, fairly priced land, calls the utility, and learns the needed power will not be available for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.85 Tm (six years, a scenario described as real and happening across the industry right now [8UjhKryCNbQ @ 00:00:00]. Reed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.62 Tm (Smith LLP treats the phrase itself as the trap, calling powered land a marketing term because power commitments) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.40 Tm (come in very different forms, and a letter of intent is very different from a signed agreement; that has to be pinned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.17 Tm (down early, before clients burn time, money, and resources chasing a site with no contracted power [HXjpQWcZ6F8) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.95 Tm (@ 00:00:30]. The Reed Smith fix is contractual: off ramps and flexibility to terminate if power is not or cannot be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 251.72 Tm (contractually committed in the client's timeframe, plus walk-away or renegotiation rights if a moratorium blocks the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 236.50 Tm (build [HXjpQWcZ6F8 @ 00:02:17]. Zoning is the second killer. In the Academy's three-site case, Site C had power in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.27 Tm (two years but strong local opposition to rezoning, and the team passed because a rezoning delay can cost more than the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.05 Tm (land itself, while Site A's six-year power timeline made it almost worthless for now [8UjhKryCNbQ @ 00:04:59].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.82 Tm (Tax credit buyers carry the downside after the wire. Andrew Dubinsky is explicit that once a 6418 credit is transferred,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 175.60 Tm (the buyer is liable for anything the IRS objects to and has to collect from the seller; Dubinsky pegs an IRS invalidation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.37 Tm (at about a one in 20,000 chance, but the buyer is effectively on the hook for the money anyway [h0qEAIoQ4Jo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.15 Tm (00:05:27]. The pitch trap is the registration number. Dubinsky warns that a seller saying the IRS registered the credits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.92 Tm (means nothing, because the number is a tracking number, a claim check that confers no validity or blessing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 114.70 Tm ([h0qEAIoQ4Jo @ 00:08:50]. Supply is also less ready than it looks: most credits are not ready to transact when they hit) Tj ET
